{"candidateAnswer":"A North American destination","evidence":"[D16:9 | 5:13 pm on 9 July, 2022] James: I also love to read, especially while snuggled under the covers on a cold winter day. But now it’s summer and I want something more exciting! By the way, I bought air tickets to Toronto, and I’m leaving the day after tomorrow evening.\n[D16:11 | 5:13 pm on 9 July, 2022] James: I also plan to visit Vancouver. Maybe, I'll go somewhere else.","itemId":"urn:uuid:3c21fd6a-6335-5b2c-8544-3541bb357cd0","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:7029678c051789726acb24753635bea760e5c26cda3f5ee32fe3595258e795b9","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Which country did James book tickets for in July 2022?","referenceAnswer":"Canada","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"7029678c051789726acb24753635bea760e5c26cda3f5ee32fe3595258e795b9"}}]}